  <h1>Privacy Policy for Duplicate</h1>
  <p><strong>Developer:</strong> Wander Heuvelman</p>
  <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 13-10-2026</p>

  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how the Duplicate app, developed by
    Wander Heuvelman, handles information relating to its users.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Data Collection</h2>
  <p>
    Duplicate is designed not to collect, store, or transmit personal
    information from its users. The app does not require users to
    create an account or provide personal information to use its
    core functionality.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Analytics and Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The developer does not intentionally use the app to collect
    personal information for analytics or advertising.
  </p>
  <p>
    Autodesk services or software development kits are included
    in the app, their data practices must be reviewed separately.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Data Storage and Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    The developer does not intentionally collect or share users'
    personal information through Duplicate. Information that users
    create or access locally on their own devices may remain on
    those devices, depending on how the app operates and the
    device's settings.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Duplicate is not intended to collect personal information from
    children. The app does not intentionally request personal
    information from its users.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Third-Party Platforms and Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    App stores, operating system providers, and any services used
    to distribute or host this policy may process technical
    information under their own privacy policies. For example,
    the website hosting provider may process server logs, including
    IP addresses, for security purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy may be updated if the app's functionality
    or data practices change. The latest version will be published
    at the policy URL associated with the app.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about this Privacy Policy, contact the developer:
    Wander Heuvelman.
  </p>
  <p>
    Contact email: whappsupport@proton.me
  </p>
